Source: MechanicDB, https://github.com/MechanicDB/MechanicDB-public

Changes made for Fahis: the repair procedures were reshaped to one file per use,
numbering was removed from the steps, the Arabic text was translated, and entries
marked with the source "Fahis" were written for Fahis and added.

These two files are an adapted database. They are offered under ODbL v1.0, not under
the Fahis license, and you may reuse them under its terms.

Parts costs (in US dollars) and labor hours are editorial estimates, not quotes. The
order of the procedures is the order to consider them in, not how likely each cause is.
Repair steps are educational reference material, not a substitute for the vehicle
manufacturer's service manual.
